    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Unified Tomorrow.io v4 HTTP API for weather and climate intelligence. Combines realtime observations, forecast timelines (minutely, hourly, daily, current), historical data up to 20 years, weather along a route, raster map tiles, plus management surfaces for Locations, Insights, Alerts, and Events.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Tomorrow.io Support",
